      "findingMessages": {
        "p0003-dead-file-001": "No call site for verify_file exists anywhere in the repository (repo-wide word search finds only its definition). Its doc comment says the model-folder selection flow calls it so manually supplied model files get the same size and SHA-256 checks. No such caller exists, so the promised check never runs on that path and the doc describes behavior the code does not have.",
        "p0003-dead-file-002": "The method cull_burst has no caller anywhere in the repository (repo-wide word search finds only its definition). The provider-culling path it documents, including its frozen-rate budget reserve and receipt handling, is unreachable from any code in this repo.",
        "p0003-dead-file-003": "current_wb has no caller anywhere in the repository (repo-wide word search finds only its definition). Its doc comment says it exists for UI display of the effective temperature and tint, but no UI path reaches it, so the displayed value comes from somewhere else or is not shown."
      },
